# Real, project-specific working copies - the tracked file is the sanitized template
# (redeploy-tweaks-template.ps1); a real per-project script is a customized copy of it,
# never meant to be published here.
redeploy-tweaks.*.ps1
!redeploy-tweaks-template.ps1

# Local machine/user state - regenerated automatically on first run, never shared.
projects.json
viewer-settings.json
RedeployFTP.lnk

# Old historical backups kept locally during development - not meant to be published.
*.backup.hta
*.backup*.ps1

# Local tooling/editor state - dot-prefixed folders are always machine-local, never published.
.*/

# Per-project secrets/config this app already expects to live OUTSIDE what's published -
# only relevant if a real project folder ever ends up nested under this one.
.ftptargets.ps1
.redeploy-secrets.ps1
